# DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel — README (brief)

Purpose
- Discrete Multi-Start / DMS driver and objective evaluation code. This folder contains the driver, DMS outputs and the interface with ANSYS.

Key files & functions
- Driver and parameters:
  - [DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/driver_dms_discreto.m](DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/driver_dms_discreto.m) — top-level DMS driver (initialization, calls `dmsAguilar`).
  - [DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/parameters_dms.m](DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/parameters_dms.m) — DMS configuration (list size, alfa_ini, nPini).
- Objective / ANSYS interface:
  - [DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/funcFF.m](DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/funcFF.m) — builds inputs, calls ANSYS, reads [Code Ansys/Output_EMCC.txt](Code Ansys/Output_EMCC.txt) and returns F.
- Helpers and I/O:
  - [DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/dms_report.txt](DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/dms_report.txt) — iteration log from the DMS run.
  - [DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/dms_paretofront.txt](DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/dms_paretofront.txt) — raw Pareto front cache.
  - [DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/Determina_pontos_ND_2a2.m](DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/Determina_pontos_ND_2a2.m) — post-processing and plotting Pareto fronts.
  - [DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/plot_patches_with_domain.m](DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/plot_patches_with_domain.m) — visual helper for patches.
  - [`optimize_patch_centers`](DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/optimize_patch_centers.m) — local copy to compute absolute centers and validate overlap.
  - [`clean_and_sort_centers`](DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/clean_and_sort_centers.m) — removes invalid centers and reorders.
  - [DMS_Discreto.6_multivariavel/dms_cache.txt] (generated by runs).

How it flows (short)
1. `driver_dms_discreto.m` prepares candidate points and calls DMS optimizer (`dmsAguilar`).
2. DMS calls `funcFF.m` for each candidate; `funcFF.m` writes `Input_*.txt` into `Code Ansys/` and launches ANSYS; it reads back `Output_EMCC.txt`.
3. Results are stored in pareto files (`dms_paretofront.txt`, `dms_report.txt`) and later visualized via `Determina_pontos_ND_2a2.m`.

Run notes
- Requires ANSYS installed at the path used in `funcFF.m`.
- Keep working directories consistent (scripts change directories; ensure permissions).